---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"presets\", \"export\"])"
---
Write a saved preset to a `.ympreset` file

Usage: ym presets export [OPTIONS] <NAME> <FILE>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  The preset to write
  <FILE>  The `.ympreset` file to write. A file that is there is written over

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
